  "details": "Description\n\nthe video players will not Play any URL from youtube and will constantly give video error retrying the load then fail to load video constantly it happens to all video players for every single person on vrchat\n\nReproduction Steps\n\nit is something that will happen all the time for everyone\n\nDetails\n\n- Category: Other\n\n- Frequency: Always\n\n---\n\nplatform: PC (platform: Windows, store: Steam, headset: None)\n\nrawPlatform: WindowsPlayer\n\nclientVersion: 2026.3.1-1886-a268441585-Release\n\nunityVersion: 2022.3.22f2-DWR\n\nIn-Client Report\n\n---\n\n**Log file:** [output_log_2026-08-22_14-19-11.txt](https://api.vrchat.cloud/api/1/file/file_7dcdf2ba-72da-4a66-90bf-b6667227b6a6/1/file)",
